    "<div>\n          <div>\n            <span>B</span>\n            <h3>SECTION B: LANGUAGE FOCUS (2.6 pts)</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n\n          <!-- Part I Multiple Choice -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h4>\n                I. Complete the following sentences by choosing the best option A, B, C or D. (2.0 pts)\n              </h4>\n              <p>Các từ đơn lẻ có biểu tượng 🔊 để hỗ trợ nghe phát âm chuẩn.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n\n              <!-- Q1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q2 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q3 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q4 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q5 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q6 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q7 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q8 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q9 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q10 -->\n              \n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Part II Verb Form -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h4>\n                II. Give the correct forms of the verb or the word in bracket. (0.6 pts)\n              </h4>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <!-- Q1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q2 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q3 -->\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <div>\n            <span>C</span>\n            <h3>SECTION C. READING (2.6 pts)</h3>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n\n          <!-- Part I Cloze Reading -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h4>\n                Part I. Read the following passage carefully and fill the numbered gap(s) with a suitable word. (1.0 pt)\n              </h4>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Given word bank -->\n            <div>\n              <span>health </span>\n              <span>pressure </span>\n              <span>leisure </span>\n              <span>social </span>\n              <span>spending </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Reading Passage 1 with dropdowns/inputs -->\n            <div>\n              <p>\n                Being a teenager, I face a considerable amount of\n                <span>(1)</span>\n                \n                from my parents, schoolwork and even my friends. In this day and age where a majority of teenagers use\n                <span>(2)</span>\n                \n                media, I also have to face pressure from the online community. Teenagers like me suffer from increased stress because they try to copy the seemingly perfect life portrayed on social media. Plus,\n                <span>(3)</span>\n                \n                time more frequently on social media also makes me delay other important tasks.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                These negative impacts of social media are not new to me, but they became clearer following my summer break in the countryside. After three months in my grandparents' hometown with limited internet access, I realised how bad social media was for my mental\n                <span>(4)</span>\n                .\n                Without social media, I felt happier, I had more\n                <span>(5)</span>\n                \n                time, and I spent more time outdoors helping my grandfather with gardening. When I got back to school, I decided to decrease my time spent on the internet and quit social media.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Explanations for Cloze (Hidden initially) -->\n            \n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Part II Comprehension Reading -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h4>\n                Part II. Read the following passage about health carefully and answer the questions or decide if the statements are true (T) or false (F). (1.6 pts)\n              </h4>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Passage -->\n            <div>\n              <p>\n                Terraced rice fields are located in the northern mountainous provinces. Local ethnic minority peoples can grow rice and establish terraced rice fields, one after another, from the foot to nearly top of mountains. In distance, the terraced rice fields look like a picture of nature with heart-catching beauty keeping tourists to stay for admiration for a while.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                This picture however has its colour changed seasonally. As usual in April and May, the local people water their fields at full to prepare for a new crop. At this time, the surface of terraced fields shines like a mirror. In June and July, the terraced rice fields with fully-grown paddy rice and forest trees spread the green out to the entire area. In September and October when autumn ends, the terraced rice fields look like golden silk scarves flying over in the wind above green mountain slopes.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Famous terraced rice fields can be found in Yen Bai, Ha Giang. Especially, the fields in Sa Pa (Lao Cai Province) were voted as one of seven most beautiful and impressive terraced rice fields of Asia.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Questions 1-5 -->\n            <div>\n\n              <!-- Q1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q2 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q3 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q4 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q5 -->\n              \n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <div>\n            <span>D</span>\n            <h3>SECTION D. WRITING (1.4 pts)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span>Đã lược bỏ phần Paragraph Writing cuối</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n\n          <!-- Part I Rearrange (Interactive Boxes) -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h4>\n                I. Rearrange the provided words/phrases to complete a sentence. (0.6 pts)\n              </h4>\n              <p>Bấm vào các ô từ/cụm từ theo thứ tự để ghép thành câu đúng. Dấu chấm cuối câu sẽ được hệ thống tự động hoàn thiện.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Rearrange Question 1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Rearrange Question 2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Rearrange Question 3 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Part II Sentence Transformation -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <h4>\n                II. Finish each of the following sentences in such a way that it means exactly the same as the one printed before it (0.8 pts)\n              </h4>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n\n              <!-- Q1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q2 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q3 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q4 -->\n              \n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>"
